INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zubayer0077/Claude-Multi-Agent-Research-System-Skill/multi-agent-researcher', 'multi-agent-researcher', 'zubayer0077', 'Claude-Multi-Agent-Research-System-Skill', 'community', 'multi-agent-researcher zubayer0077 Claude-Multi-Agent-Research-System-Skill community The multi-agent-researcher skill transforms complex research questions into comprehensive reports by decomposing topics and synthesizing findings. It benefits researchers and developers seeking structured investigations and seamless workflow planning. 多智能体研究协调器通过分解复杂研究问题、并行执行和审计，生成综合报告 マルチエージェント研究コーディネーターは、複雑な研究問題を分解し、並列実行と監査を実行して包括的な報告書を生成する 멀티 에이전트 리서치 코디네이터는 복잡한 연구 문제를 분해하고 병렬 실행과 감사를 통해 포괄적인 보고서를 생성합니다 El multi-agent-researcher permite investigaciones paralelas y estructuradas, descomponiendo temas complejos en subtemas enfocados Le multi-agent-researcher permet des recherches parallèles et structurées, en décomposant des sujets complexes en sous-sujets ciblés Der multi-agent-researcher ermöglicht parallele und strukturierte Recherchen, indem komplexe Themen in fokussierte Subthemen zerlegt werden O multi-agent-researcher é uma ferramenta que transforma questões de pesquisa complexas em relatórios abrangentes com execução paralela e auditorias ИИ Агенты multi-agent-researcher преобразуют сложные исследовательские вопросы в комплексные отчеты с параллельным выполнением и аудитами يحول multi-agent-researcher أسئلة البحث المعقدة إلى تقارير شاملة مع التنفيذ الموازي والتدقيق how to use multi-agent-researcher what is multi-agent-researcher multi-agent-researcher alternative multi-agent-researcher vs other research tools multi-agent-researcher install multi-agent-researcher setup guide parallel execution in research structured research workflows research agent automation 多智能体研究协调器 AI工具 并行执行 审计和结构化输出 研究代理 综合报告 工作流计划 研究问题分解 Decomposes broad topics into 2-4 focused subtopics Spawns specialized researcher agents in parallel for efficient research Synthesizes findings into cohesive final reports Saves structured outputs for reference and future use Auto-invoke capability for search and discovery tasks Supports seamless workflow planning and execution multi-agent-researcher is a skill that orchestrates multi-agent research with parallel execution and audits for efficient investigations and workflow planning.');
