Setup Guide: SQLite 灾难恢复工具","ja":"Litestream セットアップガイド: SQLite ディザスタリカバリーツール","ko":"Litestream 설정 가이드: SQLite 재해 복구 도구","es":"Guía de configuración de Litestream para recuperación de ...","fr":"Guide de configuration de Litestream pour la récupération...","de":"Litestream-Einrichtungsleitfaden für SQLite-Notfallwieder...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Litestream para Recuperação de De...","ru":"Настройка Litestream для ИИ Агентов: Руководство по Настр...","ar":"دليل إعداد Litestream لعمليات الاستعادة بعد الكارثة"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to implement litestream for AI assistants, ensuring seamless database replication and disaster recovery - get started now!","zh":"了解 Litestream，一个为 SQLite 提供灾难恢复功能的工具。监控 WAL，转换为 LTX 文件，并上传到云存储","ja":"Litestream を紹介します。SQLite 用のディザスタリカバリーツールで、WAL を監視し、LTX ファイルに変換してクラウドストレージにアップロードします","ko":"Litestream 소개: SQLite 재해 복구 도구로 WAL 모니터링, LTX 파일 변환, 클라우드 저장소 업로드 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Aprende a configurar Litestream para proteger tus bases de datos SQLite contra desastres y pérdida de datos con nuestra guía paso a paso","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer Litestream pour protéger vos bases de données SQLite contre les pertes de données et les catastrophes avec notre guide étape par...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Litestream einrichten, um Ihre SQLite-Datenbanken vor Datenverlust und Katastrophen zu schützen, mit unserem Schritt-für-Schritt-Leitfaden","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Litestream para garantir a recuperação de desastres do SQLite com nossa guia passo a passo","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Litestream для ИИ Агентов и обеспечить восстановление после сбоев базы данных SQLite","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد Litestream لضمان استعادة البيانات بعد الكارثة مع دليلنا الشامل"},"definition":{"en":"litestream is a background process that replicates SQLite database changes to cloud storage, ensuring data integrity and disaster recovery","zh":"Litestream 是一个为 SQLite 提供灾难恢复功能的工具","ja":"Litestream は SQLite 用のディザスタリカバリーツールです","ko":"Litestream은 SQLite 재해 복구 도구입니다","es":"Litestream es una herramienta de recuperación de desastres que monitorea el registro de escritura anticipada de SQLite y replica los cambios a almacenamiento en la nube","fr":"Litestream est un outil de récupération de données qui surveille le journal de écriture anticipée de SQLite et réplique les modifications vers un stockage cloud","de":"Litestream ist ein Tool für die Notfallwiederherstellung, das das Write-Ahead-Log von SQLite überwacht und Änderungen auf Cloud-Speicher überträgt","pt":"O que é Litestream? É uma ferramenta de recuperação de desastres para o SQLite","ru":"Что такое Litestream? Это инструмент восстановления после сбоев для SQLite","ar":"ما هو Litestream؟ إنه أداة لاستعادة البيانات بعد الكارثة ل SQLite"},"features":{"en":["WAL Monitoring: watches SQLite Write-Ahead Log for changes at configurable intervals","LTX File generation: converts database page changes to immutable files","Cloud storage upload: seamlessly uploads LTX files to chosen storage backend","Configurable intervals: allows for customizable monitoring intervals, defaulting to 1s","Immutable LTX files: ensures database page changes are never modified"],"zh":["WAL 监控","LTX 文件转换","云存储上传","可配置的监控间隔","Immutable LTX 文件"],"ja":["WAL 監視","LTX ファイル変換","クラウドストレージアップロード","設定可能な監視間隔","Immutable LTX ファイル"],"ko":["WAL 모니터링","LTX 파일 변환","클라우드 저장소 업로드","설정 가능한 모니터링 간격","Immutable LTX 파일"],"es":["Monitoreo del registro de escritura anticipada de SQLite","Replicación continua de cambios a almacenamiento en la nube","Creación de archivos LTX inmutables","Subida de archivos LTX a almacenamiento en la nube","Configuración de intervalos de monitoreo personalizables","Compatibilidad con diferentes proveedores de almacenamiento en la nube"],"fr":["Surveillance du journal de écriture anticipée de SQLite","Réplication continue des modifications vers un stockage cloud","Création de fichiers LTX inaltérables","Téléchargement de fichiers LTX vers un stockage cloud","Configuration d''intervalles de surveillance personnalisables","Compatibilité avec différents fournisseurs de stockage cloud"],"de":["Überwachung des Write-Ahead-Logs von SQLite","Kontinuierliche Replikation von Änderungen auf Cloud-Speicher","Erstellung von unveränderlichen LTX-Dateien","Hochladen von LTX-Dateien auf Cloud-Speicher","Konfiguration von anpassbaren Überwachungsintervallen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Cloud-Speicher-Anbietern"],"pt":["Monitoramento do WAL (Write-Ahead Log) do SQLite","Criação de arquivos LTX imutáveis","Upload de alterações para o armazenamento em nuvem","Replicação contínua das alterações do banco de dados","Integração com armazenamento em nuvem"],"ru":["Мониторинг WAL (Write-Ahead Log) базы данных SQLite","Создание неизменяемых файлов LTX","Загрузка изменений в облачное хранилище","Непрерывная репликация изменений базы данных","Интеграция с облачным хранилищем"],"ar":["مراقبة سجل WAL (Write-Ahead Log) ل SQLite","إنشاء ملفات LTX غير قابلة للتغيير","تحميل التغييرات إلى التخزين السحابي","تكرار مستمر لتغييرات قاعدة البيانات","الاندماج مع التخزين السحابي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use litestream","litestream alternative","litestream setup guide","what is litestream","litestream vs database replication tools","litestream install for AI assistants","SQLite disaster recovery","LTX file format","WAL monitoring interval"],"zh":["Litestream","SQLite 灾难恢复","WAL 监控","LTX 文件转换","云存储上传","AI 工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Litestream","SQLite ディザスタリカバリ","WAL 監視","LTX ファイル変換","クラウドストレージアップロード","AI ツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Litestream","SQLite 재해 복구","WAL 모니터링","LTX 파일 변환","클라우드 저장소 업로드","AI 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Litestream","recuperación de desastres","SQLite","almacenamiento en la nube","replicación de datos","monitoreo de registro de escritura anticipada","archivos LTX","configuración de intervalos de monitoreo","herramientas de recuperación de desastres"],"fr":["Litestream","récupération de données","SQLite","stockage cloud","réplication de données","surveillance du journal de écriture anticipée","fichiers LTX","configuration d''intervalles de surveillance","outils de récupération de données"],"de":["Litestream","Notfallwiederherstellung","SQLite","Cloud-Speicher","Datenreplikation","Überwachung des Write-Ahead-Logs","LTX-Dateien","Konfiguration von Überwachungsintervallen","Tools für die Notfallwiederherstellung"],"pt":["Litestream","recuperação de desastres","SQLite","armazenamento em nuvem","WAL monitoring","LTX files","replicação contínua","ferramenta de recuperação de desastres","configuração do Litestream"],"ru":["Litestream","восстановление после сбоев","SQLite","облачное хранилище","Мониторинг WAL","Файлы LTX","Непрерывная репликация","Инструмент восстановления после сбоев","Настройка Litestream"],"ar":["Litestream","استعادة البيانات بعد الكارثة","SQLite","التخزين السحابي","مراقبة سجل WAL","ملفات LTX","تكرار مستمر","أداة استعادة البيانات بعد الكارثة","إعداد Litestream"]}},"owner":"benbjohnson","repo":"litestream-skills","repoPath":"benbjohnson/litestream-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.423Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"litestream","description":"SQLite disaster recovery and streaming replication to cloud storage (S3, GCS, Azure, SFTP, NATS). Use this skill for configuring Litestream, deploying to cloud platforms, troubleshooting WAL replication issues, implementing point-in-time recovery, and setting up VFS read replicas.","version":"0.5.5","bodyPreview":"# Litestream\n\nLitestream is a disaster recovery tool for SQLite that runs as a background process, continuously replicating database changes to cloud storage. It monitors the SQLite Write-Ahead Log (WAL), converts changes to immutable LTX files, and uploads them to your chosen storage backend.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **WAL Monitoring**: Watches SQLite Write-Ahead Log for changes at configurable intervals (default 1s)\n- **LTX Files**: Immutable files containing database page changes, never modified a","body":"# Litestream\n\nLitestream is a disaster recovery tool for SQLite that runs as a background process, continuously replicating database changes to cloud storage. It monitors the SQLite Write-Ahead Log (WAL), converts changes to immutable LTX files, and uploads them to your chosen storage backend.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **WAL Monitoring**: Watches SQLite Write-Ahead Log for changes at configurable intervals (default 1s)\n- **LTX Files**: Immutable files containing database page changes, never modified after creation\n- **Level-Based Compaction**: Multi-level system (L0-L9) that merges LTX files to reduce storage overhead\n- **Point-in-Time Recovery**: Restore to any transaction using TXID or timestamp\n- **VFS Support**: Read replicas directly from cloud storage without local database copy\n- **MCP Server**: AI tool integration for automated database management\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# macOS\nbrew install litestream\n\n# Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)\nwget https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream/releases/download/v0.5.5/litestream-v0.5.5-linux-amd64.deb\nsudo dpkg -i litestream-v0.5.5-linux-amd64.deb\n\n# Docker\ndocker pull litestream/litestream:0.5\n```\n\n### Basic Replication\n\n```bash\n# Command line (single database)\nlitestream replicate /path/to/db.sqlite s3://bucket/db\n\n# With config file\nlitestream replicate -config /etc/litestream.yml\n```\n\n### Restore Database\n\n```bash\n# Restore latest backup\nlitestream restore -o /path/to/restored.db s3://bucket/db\n\n# Point-in-time recovery\nlitestream restore -timestamp 2024-01-15T10:30:00Z -o /tmp/db s3://bucket/db\n\n# Restore to specific transaction\nlitestream restore -txid 1000 -o /tmp/db s3://bucket/db\n```\n\n### Check Status\n\n```bash\n# View all databases and their replication status\nlitestream status\n\n# List available LTX files\nlitestream ltx /path/to/db.sqlite\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\nThese rules are essential for correct Litestream operation:\n\n1. **Lock Page at 1GB**: SQLite reserves the page at offset 0x40000000 (1GB). This page must always be skipped during replication and compaction. The page number varies by page size:\n   - 4KB pages: page 262145\n   - 8KB pages: page 131073\n   - 16KB pages: page 65537\n\n2. **LTX Files are Immutable**: Once created, LTX files are never modified. New changes create new files.\n\n3. **Single Replica per Database**: Each database can only replicate to one destination. Use multiple Litestream instances for multiple destinations.\n\n4. **WAL Mode Required**: SQLite must be in WAL mode (`PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL;`)\n\n5. **Use `litestream ltx`**: The `litestream wal` command is deprecated.\n\n## Storage Backends\n\n| Backend | URL Scheme | Example |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| AWS S3 | `s3://` | `s3://bucket/path` |\n| S3-Compatible (R2, Tigris, MinIO) | `s3://` | `s3://bucket/path?endpoint=host:port` |\n| Google Cloud Storage | `gs://` | `gs://bucket/path` |\n| Azure Blob Storage | `abs://` | `abs://container@account/path` |\n| SFTP | `sftp://` | `sftp://user@host:22/path` |\n| NATS JetStream | `nats://` | `nats://host:4222/bucket` |\n| WebDAV | `webdav://` | `webdav://host/path` |\n| Alibaba OSS | `oss://` | `oss://bucket/path` |\n| Local File | (path) | `/var/backups/db` |\n\n## Configuration File Example\n\n```yaml\ndbs:\n  - path: /data/app.db\n    replica:\n      url: s3://my-bucket/app-backup\n      access-key-id: ${AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}\n      secret-access-key: ${AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}\n      region: us-east-1\n      sync-interval: 1s\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Litestream skill when:\n- Configuring SQLite database replication to cloud storage\n- Setting up disaster recovery for SQLite applications\n- Troubleshooting replication issues (WAL growth, sync failures)\n- Implementing point-in-time recovery procedures\n- Deploying Litestream with Docker, Fly.io, Kubernetes, or systemd\n- Understanding WAL-based replication concepts\n\n## Skill Contents\n\n- `concepts/` - Architecture, replication mechanics, LTX format, SQLite WAL, VFS support, compaction\n- `configuration/` - Storage backend configurations (S3, GCS, Azure, SFTP, NATS, OSS, WebDAV, File)\n- `commands/` - CLI command reference (replicate, restore, status, ltx, databases)\n- `operations/` - Monitoring, troubleshooting, recovery, and heartbeat monitoring\n- `deployment/` - Docker, Fly.io, Kubernetes, and systemd deployment guides\n- `integrations/` - MCP server integration for AI tools\n- `scripts/` - Validation and diagnostic helper scripts\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### WAL Growing Too Large\n- Check sync interval (default 1s may be too slow for write-heavy workloads)\n- Verify storage backend connectivity\n- Check for checkpoint blocking (long-running transactions)\n\n### Replication Lag\n- Monitor with `litestream status`\n- Check network connectivity to storage backend\n- Review sync interval configuration\n\n### Restore Failures\n- Verify backup exists: `litestream ltx /path/to/db`\n- Check storage backend credentials\n- Ensure target directory is writable\n\n## Links\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://litestream.io)\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream)\n- [Getting Started Guide](https://litestream.io/getting-started/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:25.826Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Assistant Developers utilizing SQLite databases and requiring continuous replication for disaster recovery purposes.","zh":"适用于利用 SQLite 数据库并需要持续复制以实现灾难恢复目的的 AI 助手开发者。","ja":"SQLite データベースを利用し、災害復旧のために継続的なレプリケーションを必要とする AI アシスタント開発者に最適です。","ko":"SQLite 데이터베이스를 사용하고 재해 복구를 위해 지속적인 복제가 필요한 AI 어시스턴트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de asistentes de AI que utilizan bases de datos SQLite y requieren replicación continua para fines de recuperación de desastres.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''assistants d''IA utilisant des bases de données SQLite et nécessitant une réplication continue pour des fins de reprise après sinistre.","de":"Ideal für AI-Assistenten-Entwickler, die SQLite-Datenbanken nutzen und eine kontinuierliche Replikation für Zwecke der Notfallwiederherstellung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de Assistente de IA que utilizam bancos de dados SQLite e exigem replicação contínua para fins de recuperação de desastres.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков помощников ИИ, использующих базы данных SQLite и требующих непрерывной репликации для целей восстановления после аварий.","ar":"مثالية لمطوري مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يستخدمون قواعد بيانات SQLite ويتطلبون تكرارًا مستمرًا لأغراض التعافي من الكوارث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain immutable LTX files through continuous database replication, leveraging SQLite Write-Ahead Log monitoring and cloud storage upload capabilities, ensuring data integrity via WAL monitoring and LTX file conversion.","zh":"赋予代理维护不可变的 LTX 文件的能力，通过持续数据库复制，利用 SQLite Write-Ahead Log 监控和云存储上传能力，确保通过 WAL 监控和 LTX 文件转换的数据完整性。","ja":"エージェントが不変の LTX ファイルを維持できるようにし、継続的なデータベースレプリケーションを通じて、SQLite Write-Ahead Log モニタリングとクラウドストレージアップロード機能を利用し、WAL モニタリングと LTX ファイル変換を通じてデータの完全性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 불변의 LTX 파일을 유지할 수 있도록 하여 지속적인 데이터베이스 복제를 통해 SQLite Write-Ahead Log 모니터링과 클라우드 스토리지 업로드 기능을 활용하고 WAL 모니터링 및 LTX 파일 변환을 통해 데이터 무결성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener archivos LTX inmutables a través de la replicación continua de la base de datos, aprovechando el monitoreo de registros de escritura anticipada de SQLite y las capacidades de carga de almacenamiento en la nube, asegurando la integridad de los datos a través del monitoreo de WAL y la conversión de archivos LTX.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des fichiers LTX immuables via une réplication continue de la base de données, en exploitant la surveillance des journaux d''écriture anticipée SQLite et les capacités de téléchargement de stockage dans le cloud, en assurant l''intégrité des données via la surveillance de WAL et la conversion de fichiers LTX.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, immutable LTX-Dateien durch kontinuierliche Datenbankreplikation zu warten, indem sie die Überwachung von SQLite-Write-Ahead-Logs und die Cloud-Speicher-Upload-Funktionen nutzen, um die Datenintegrität durch WAL-Überwachung und LTX-Dateikonvertierung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter arquivos LTX imutáveis por meio da replicação contínua do banco de dados, utilizando o monitoramento do registro de gravação antecipada do SQLite e as capacidades de upload de armazenamento em nuvem, garantindo a integridade dos dados por meio do monitoramento do WAL e da conversão de arquivos LTX.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать неизменные файлы LTX посредством непрерывной репликации базы данных, используя мониторинг журнала предварительной записи SQLite и возможности загрузки в облачное хранилище, обеспечивая целостность данных посредством мониторинга WAL и преобразования файлов LTX.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الحفاظ على ملفات LTX غير قابلة للتغيير من خلال التكرار المستمر لقاعدة البيانات، باستخدام مراقبة سجل الكتابة المسبقة ل SQLite وقدرات تحميل التخزين السحابي، مما يضمن سلامة البيانات من خلال مراقبة WAL وتحويل ملفات LTX."},"useCases":{"en":["Replicating SQLite databases to cloud storage for disaster recovery","Monitoring SQLite Write-Ahead Logs for real-time change detection","Converting database changes to immutable LTX files for version control"],"zh":["将 SQLite 数据库复制到云存储中以实现灾难恢复","监控 SQLite Write-Ahead 日志以实现实时更改检测","将数据库更改转换为不可变的 LTX 文件以实现版本控制"],"ja":["SQLite データベースをクラウドストレージにレプリケーションして災害復旧を行う","SQLite Write-Ahead ログをモニタリングしてリアルタイムの変更検出を行う","データベースの変更を不変の LTX ファイルに変換してバージョン管理を行う"],"ko":["SQLite 데이터베이스를 클라우드 스토리지에 복제하여 재해 복구를 수행하는 것","SQLite Write-Ahead 로그를 모니터링하여 실시간 변경 감지를 수행하는 것","데이터베이스 변경 사항을 불변의 LTX 파일로 변환하여 버전 관리를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Replicar bases de datos SQLite en almacenamiento en la nube para recuperación de desastres","Monitorear registros de escritura anticipada de SQLite para la detección de cambios en tiempo real","Convertir cambios de base de datos en archivos LTX inmutables para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Répliquer les bases de données SQLite sur un stockage dans le cloud pour la reprise après sinistre","Surveiller les journaux d''écriture anticipée SQLite pour la détection de changements en temps réel","Convertir les modifications de base de données en fichiers LTX immuables pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["SQLite-Datenbanken in Cloud-Speicher für Notfallwiederherstellung replizieren","SQLite-Write-Ahead-Logs für Echtzeit-Erkennung von Änderungen überwachen","Datenbankänderungen in unveränderliche LTX-Dateien für Versionskontrolle konvertieren"],"pt":["Replicar bancos de dados SQLite para armazenamento em nuvem para recuperação de desastres","Monitorar logs de gravação antecipada do SQLite para detecção de alterações em tempo real","Converter alterações de banco de dados em arquivos LTX imutáveis para controle de versão"],"ru":["Реплицировать базы данных SQLite в облачное хранилище для восстановления после аварий","Мониторить журналы предварительной записи SQLite для обнаружения изменений в режиме реального времени","Преобразовывать изменения базы данных в неизменные файлы LTX для контроля версий"],"ar":["تكرار قواعد بيانات SQLite إلى تخزين سحابي لاستعادة الكوارث","مراقبة سجلات الكتابة المسبقة ل SQLite للكشف عن التغييرات في الوقت الفعلي","تحويل التغييرات في قاعدة البيانات إلى ملفات LTX غير قابلة للتغيير للتحكم في الإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SQLite database","Cloud storage backend needed for replication","Runs as a background process"],"zh":["需要 SQLite 数据库","需要云存储后端用于复制","作为后台进程运行"],"ja":["SQLite データベースが必要","レプリケーションのためにクラウドストレージバックエンドが必要","バックグラウンドプロセスとして実行される"],"ko":["SQLite 데이터베이스가 필요합니다","복제를 위해 클라우드 스토리지 백엔드가 필요합니다","백그라운드 프로세스로 실행됩니다"],"es":["Requiere base de datos SQLite","Se necesita un backend de almacenamiento en la nube para la replicación","Se ejecuta como un proceso en segundo plano"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de données SQLite","Un backend de stockage dans le cloud est nécessaire pour la réplication","S''exécute comme un processus en arrière-plan"],"de":["Benötigt SQLite-Datenbank","Cloud-Speicher-Backend ist für Replikation erforderlich","Läuft als Hintergrundprozess"],"pt":["Exige banco de dados SQLite","Necessário backend de armazenamento em nuvem para replicação","Executa-se como um processo em segundo plano"],"ru":["Требуется база данных SQLite","Необходим бэкенд облачного хранилища для репликации","Выполняется как фоновый процесс"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة بيانات SQLite","يتم الحاجة إلى خلفية تخزين سحابي للتكرار","يعمل كعملية خلفية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4d67db56147b0738630bfb48a571b91665e860f68846655b8608bb9e147c0e04","qualityScore":59}');
