INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('riedel28/article-space/fsd-check', 'fsd-check', 'riedel28', 'article-space', 'community', 'fsd-check riedel28 article-space community The fsd-check AI Agent Skill validates React and TypeScript projects for strict compliance with Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) architecture. It is designed for developers and teams adopting FSD to maintain clean, scalable code structure. FSD-check 是一个现代博客平台，使用 React、TypeScript 和 Mantine 构建。它遵循严格的 FSD 方法论，包括层次结构、规则和检查 FSD-check は、React、TypeScript、Mantine を使用して構築されたモダンなブログプラットフォームです。厳格な FSD 方法論に従い、層階構造、ルール、チェックを含みます FSD-check는 React, TypeScript, Mantine을 사용하여 구축된 최신 블로그 플랫폼입니다. 엄격한 FSD 방법론을 따르며 계층 구조, 규칙 및 검사를 포함합니다 fsd-check es una herramienta de verificación de diseño de características para proyectos React y TypeScript, que sigue la metodología de Feature-Sliced Design fsd-check est un outil de vérification de conception de fonctionnalités pour les projets React et TypeScript, qui suit la méthodologie de Feature-Sliced Design fsd-check ist ein Werkzeug zur Überprüfung von Feature-Sliced-Design für React- und TypeScript-Projekte, das der Feature-Sliced-Design-Methode folgt O FSD-Check é uma ferramenta que valida a conformidade do design de recursos em plataformas de blog modernas construídas com React, TypeScript e Mantine FSD-Check - это инструмент, который проверяет соответствие дизайна функций в современных платформах блогов, построенных на React, TypeScript и Mantine с помощью ИИ Агентов FSD-Check هو أداة للتحقق من امتثال مكونات التصميم في منصات التدوين الحديثة مبنية على React و TypeScript و Mantine باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي fsd-check setup guide how to use fsd-check what is fsd-check fsd-check vs eslint fsd-check install Feature-Sliced Design checker fsd architecture validation fsd-check layer import rules FSD-check React TypeScript Mantine 现代博客平台 FSD 方法论 层次结构 规则 检查 AIエージェント Validates FSD layer hierarchy (app → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared) Enforces that layers can only import from layers below them Prevents cross-imports within the same layer (e.g., features cannot import other features) Mandates that all imports must go through a public API (`index.ts`) Checks for the use of absolute imports with the `@/*` alias fsd-check is an AI Agent Skill that automates validation of a codebase''s adherence to Feature-Sliced Design principles. It checks layer import hierarchy, enforces public API usage via `index.ts`, and mandates absolute imports with the `@/*` alias.');
