und Quest-Informationen von RuneMetrics","Strukturierte JSON-Ausgaben für den Verzehr von LLM","Kompatibilität mit der Option --json für strukturierte Ausgaben","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Loadstone-CLI-Befehlen"],"pt":["Suporte à solicitações de dados do RuneScape 3 Wiki","Suporte à solicitações de perfis e informações de quests do RuneMetrics","Saída de dados em formato JSON para consumo de LLM","Comando --json para saída estruturada","Suporte à interpretação de comandos Loadstone CLI"],"ru":["Поддержка запросов данных из RuneScape 3 Wiki","Поддержка запросов профилей и информации о квестах из RuneMetrics","Выходные данные в формате JSON для потребления LLM","Команда --json для структурированного вывода","Поддержка интерпретации команд Loadstone CLI"],"ar":["دعم طلبات البيانات من RuneScape 3 Wiki","دعم طلبات الملفات الشخصية ومعلومات القصة من RuneMetrics","إخراج البيانات بформات JSON لاستهلاك LLM","الأمر --json للخروج المنظم","دعم تفسير أوامر Loadstone CLI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use loadstone-cli","loadstone-cli setup guide","RuneScape 3 Wiki data retrieval","RuneMetrics profile info","loadstone-cli alternative","loadstone-cli vs other CLI tools","install loadstone-cli","loadstone-cli JSON output","RuneScape data processing"],"zh":["Loadstone CLI","RS3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","AI 工具","结构化 JSON 输出","Loadstone CLI 命令","用户友好的数据格式"],"ja":["Loadstone CLI","RS3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","AI エージェント","構造化 JSON 出力","Loadstone CLI コマンド","ユーザー 친화的なデータ形式"],"ko":["Loadstone CLI","RS3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","AI 도구","구조화된 JSON 출력","Loadstone CLI 명령","사용자 친화적인 데이터 형식"],"es":["loadstone-cli","RuneScape 3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","herramienta de línea de comandos","salida JSON estructurada","consumo de LLM","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Herramientas de desarrollo","Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA"],"fr":["loadstone-cli","Wiki de RuneScape 3","RuneMetrics","outil en ligne de commande","sortie JSON structurée","consommation de LLM","développement d''applications","Outils de développement","Agents d''IA","Outils d''IA"],"de":["loadstone-cli","RuneScape 3-Wiki","RuneMetrics","Kommandozeilen-Tool","strukturierte JSON-Ausgaben","Verzehr von LLM","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents","KI-Tools"],"pt":["Loadstone CLI","RuneScape 3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","CLI","JSON","LLM","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","IA","Inteligência Artificial"],"ru":["Loadstone CLI","RuneScape 3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","CLI","JSON","LLM","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","ИИ","Искусственный Интеллект"],"ar":["أداة Loadstone CLI","RuneScape 3 Wiki","RuneMetrics","واجهة سطر الأوامر","JSON","LLM","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"damianpoole","repo":"Loadstone","repoPath":"damianpoole/Loadstone","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.566Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"loadstone-cli","description":"Use the Loadstone CLI to search the RuneScape 3 Wiki for quests or item information and RuneMetrics for character information like levels, status, quests completion. Use when the user asks for RS3 wiki data, Ironman-focused answers, RuneMetrics stats, or when they want CLI command guidance for Loadstone.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Loadstone CLI Skill\n\nUse this skill to operate the Loadstone CLI in this repository and return data from the RuneScape 3 Wiki or RuneMetrics in a user-friendly format.\n\n## When to use\n\n- User asks for RS3 Wiki data (pages, categories, tables, training info)\n- User asks for RuneMetrics profile or quest info\n- User asks how to run or interpret Loadstone CLI commands\n- User wants structured JSON output for LLM consumption\n\n## Required context\n\n- Prefer `--json` when the user wants structured outp","body":"# Loadstone CLI Skill\n\nUse this skill to operate the Loadstone CLI in this repository and return data from the RuneScape 3 Wiki or RuneMetrics in a user-friendly format.\n\n## When to use\n\n- User asks for RS3 Wiki data (pages, categories, tables, training info)\n- User asks for RuneMetrics profile or quest info\n- User asks how to run or interpret Loadstone CLI commands\n- User wants structured JSON output for LLM consumption\n\n## Required context\n\n- Prefer `--json` when the user wants structured output.\n\n## Command usage\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The `loadstone` command MUST be available on the user''s PATH. Do not attempt to run it via `bun run`, `npm run`, or by pointing to source files directly.\n\n```bash\nloadstone <command> [args] [options]\n```\n\n## Profile data workflow\n\nFor token-efficient profile queries, use the filtering options:\n\n- Use `--skills-only` for skill level queries (e.g., \"what''s my crafting level?\") - reduces ~14k tokens to ~300\n- Use `--completed-quests-only` for completed quest counts\n- Use `--started-quests-only` for current quest progress\n- Use `--not-started-quests-only` for available quests to start\n- Use `--quests-only` for all quests with minimal data\n- Add `--include-raw` if you need the complete raw API response\n\n**Note:** The `raw` field is excluded by default in JSON mode to save tokens. Use `--include-raw` only when necessary.\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\n# Get only skill levels\nloadstone profile \"Some Player\" --json --skills-only\n```\n\n```bash\n# Get only completed quests\nloadstone profile \"Some Player\" --json --completed-quests-only\n```\n\n```bash\n# Get only started quests\nloadstone profile \"Some Player\" --json --started-quests-only\n```\n\n## Page content workflow\n\n- First request available headings with `--headings`.\n- Choose only the headings relevant to the user request.\n- Request those sections with `--fields \"Heading 1\",\"Heading 2\"`.\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\nloadstone page \"Abyssal whip\" --headings\n```\n\n```bash\nloadstone page \"Abyssal whip\" --fields \"Usage\",\"Drop sources\" --json\n```\n\n## Output handling\n\n- If the user asks for data, prefer `--json` and return structured results.\n- If the user asks for a summary, parse JSON and provide a concise summary.\n- If a command fails, return the error and offer a fix (missing command, network, rate limit).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:42.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Analysis Agents needing RuneScape 3 Wiki and RuneMetrics data in structured JSON format.","zh":"非常适合需要使用RuneScape 3 Wiki和RuneMetrics数据的结构化JSON格式的游戏分析代理","ja":"RuneScape 3 WikiとRuneMetricsデータを構造化されたJSON形式で使用する必要があるゲーム分析エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 JSON 형식의 RuneScape 3 Wiki 및 RuneMetrics 데이터가 필요한 게임 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de juegos que necesitan datos de RuneScape 3 Wiki y RuneMetrics en formato JSON estructurado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de jeux ayant besoin de données de RuneScape 3 Wiki et RuneMetrics au format JSON structuré.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Analyse-Agenten, die RuneScape 3 Wiki- und RuneMetrics-Daten im strukturierten JSON-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Jogos que necessitam de dados da Wiki do RuneScape 3 e do RuneMetrics em formato JSON estruturado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа игр, которым необходимы данные RuneScape 3 Wiki и RuneMetrics в структурированном формате JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمال تحليل الألعاب الذين يحتاجون إلى بيانات ويكي RuneScape 3 و RuneMetrics بشكل JSON منظم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to retrieve and process RS3 data using the Loadstone CLI, providing user-friendly JSON output for easy consumption and integration with LLMs, leveraging --json for structured output.","zh":"使代理能够使用Loadstone CLI检索和处理RS3数据，提供用户友好的JSON输出，易于消耗和与LLM集成，利用--json实现结构化输出","ja":"エージェントがLoadstone CLIを使用してRS3データを取得して処理できるようにし、--jsonを使用して構造化された出力を提供し、LLMとの統合が容易になるユーザーが扱いやすいJSON出力を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Loadstone CLI를 사용하여 RS3 데이터를检索하고 처리할 수 있도록 하며, --json을 사용하여 구조화된 출력을 제공하여 LLM과의 통합이 용이한 사용자 친화적인 JSON 출력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar y procesar datos de RS3 utilizando la CLI de Loadstone, proporcionando una salida JSON de fácil uso e integración con LLMs, aprovechando --json para la salida estructurada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer et de traiter des données RS3 en utilisant la CLI Loadstone, fournissant une sortie JSON conviviale pour une consommation et une intégration faciles avec les LLM, en exploitant --json pour la sortie structurée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, RS3-Daten mithilfe der Loadstone-CLI abzurufen und zu verarbeiten, wodurch eine benutzerfreundliche JSON-Ausgabe für eine einfache Verwendung und Integration mit LLMs bereitgestellt wird, indem --json für die strukturierte Ausgabe genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a recuperar e processar dados do RS3 usando o Loadstone CLI, fornecendo saída JSON de fácil consumo e integração com LLMs, utilizando --json para saída estruturada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать и обрабатывать данные RS3 с помощью Loadstone CLI, обеспечивая пользовательскую salida JSON для легкого потребления и интеграции с LLMs, используя --json для структурированной salida.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على استرجاع ومعالجة بيانات RS3 باستخدام Loadstone CLI ، ويوفر مخرجات JSON سهلة الاستهلاك والتكامل مع LLMs ، باستخدام --json لمخرجات منظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving RS3 Wiki pages and categories","Fetching RuneMetrics profile and quest information","Generating structured JSON output for LLM consumption","Interpreting Loadstone CLI commands"],"zh":["检索RS3 Wiki页面和类别","获取RuneMetrics个人资料和任务信息","为LLM消费生成结构化JSON输出","解释Loadstone CLI命令"],"ja":["RS3 Wikiページとカテゴリの取得","RuneMetricsプロファイルとクエスト情報の取得","LLMの消費のための構造化されたJSON出力の生成","Loadstone CLIコマンドの解釈"],"ko":["RS3 Wiki 페이지 및 카테고리检索","RuneMetrics 프로필 및 퀘스트 정보 가져오기","LLM 소비를 위한 구조화된 JSON 출력 생성","Loadstone CLI 명령 해석"],"es":["Recuperar páginas y categorías de Wiki de RS3","Recuperar información de perfil y misión de RuneMetrics","Generar salida JSON estructurada para el consumo de LLM","Interpretar comandos de la CLI de Loadstone"],"fr":["Récupérer des pages et des catégories de Wiki de RS3","Récupérer des informations de profil et de quête de RuneMetrics","Générer une sortie JSON structurée pour la consommation de LLM","Interpréter des commandes de la CLI Loadstone"],"de":["Abrufen von RS3-Wiki-Seiten und -Kategorien","Abrufen von RuneMetrics-Profil- und Quest-Informationen","Generieren von strukturierter JSON-Ausgabe für den Verzehr von LLM","Interpretieren von Loadstone-CLI-Befehlen"],"pt":["Recuperar páginas e categorias da Wiki do RS3","Buscar informações de perfil e missão do RuneMetrics","Gerar saída JSON estruturada para consumo de LLM","Interpretar comandos do Loadstone CLI"],"ru":["Извлечение страниц и категорий Wiki RS3","Получение информации о профиле и квестах RuneMetrics","Генерация структурированной salida JSON для потребления LLM","Интерпретация команд Loadstone CLI"],"ar":["استرجاع صفحات وفئات ويكي RS3","استرجاع معلومات ملف تعريف و任务 RuneMetrics","توليد مخرجات JSON منظم لاستهلاك LLM","تفسير أوامر Loadstone CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Loadstone CLI installation and configuration","Limited to RuneScape 3 Wiki and RuneMetrics data"],"zh":["需要Loadstone CLI的安装和配置","仅限RuneScape 3 Wiki和RuneMetrics数据"],"ja":["Loadstone CLIのインストールと設定が必要","RuneScape 3 WikiとRuneMetricsデータのみ"],"ko":["Loadstone CLI 설치 및 구성 필요","RuneScape 3 Wiki 및 RuneMetrics 데이터만"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de la CLI de Loadstone","Limitado a los datos de RuneScape 3 Wiki y RuneMetrics"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de la CLI Loadstone","Limité aux données de Wiki de RS3 et de RuneMetrics"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration der Loadstone-CLI","Begrenzt auf Daten von RuneScape 3 Wiki und RuneMetrics"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Loadstone CLI","Limitado a dados da Wiki do RuneScape 3 e do RuneMetrics"],"ru":["Требуется установка и настройка Loadstone CLI","Ограничен данными Wiki RuneScape 3 и RuneMetrics"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب وتكوين Loadstone CLI","محدود ببيانات ويكي RuneScape 3 و RuneMetrics"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"233ffbe8fe39880e1248739bd84ea3611d5e7ade465b2b0c724a1b8b9fb08c36","qualityScore":59}');
