éé via un workflow interactif","de":"Ein PRD ist ein Dokument, das die Anforderungen eines Produkts beschreibt, erstellt durch einen interaktiven Workflow","pt":"O que é PRD? É uma habilidade que gera documentos de requisitos de produto interativos e estruturados.","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агенты PRD? Это habilidade, которая создает комплексные технические требования к продукту.","ar":"ما هو برد؟ هي مهارة تقوم بتوليد مستندات متطلبات المنتج الشاملة والمنظمة."},"features":{"en":["Generates comprehensive Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) through an interactive question-and-answer workflow","Follows a structured 5-step process for efficient PRD creation","Optimized for autonomous development and planning new features","Breaks down complex features into implementable stories","Utilizes error handling, process scheduling, memory management, and feedback learning through Ralph Zero"],"zh":["交互式问答工作流","自动创建综合的产品需求文档","优化自动化开发","支持复杂多步骤功能","实现错误处理和过程调度"],"ja":["交互式の質問と回答のワークフロー","包括的な製品要件文書を自動生成","自動開発を最適化","複雑な多段階機能をサポート","エラー処理とプロセススケジューリングを実現"],"ko":["상호작용형 질문과 답변 작업 흐름","포괄적인 제품 요구 사항 문서를 자동 생성","자동화 개발을 최적화","복잡한 다단계 기능을 지원","오류 처리와 프로세스 스케줄링을 구현"],"es":["Generación de PRD a través de un flujo de trabajo interactivo de 5 pasos","Orquestación de Ralph Zero para agentes de IA","Gestión de errores y programación de procesos","Aprendizaje de retroalimentación y gestión de memoria","Compatibilidad con la creación de historias implementables"],"fr":["Création de PRD via un workflow interactif de 5 étapes","Orchestration de Ralph Zero pour les outils d''IA","Gestion des erreurs et planification de processus","Apprentissage de rétroaction et gestion de mémoire","Compatibilité avec la création d''histoires implementables"],"de":["Erstellung von PRD durch einen interaktiven 5-Schritt-Workflow","Orchestrierung von Ralph Zero für KI-Agents","Fehlermanagement und Prozessplanung","Rückmeldelernen und Speichermanagement","Kompatibilität mit der Erstellung von umsetzbaren Geschichten"],"pt":["Geração de documentos de requisitos de produto interativos","Processo de 5 etapas estruturado","Trabalho com erro de manipulação e agendamento de processos","Aprendizado de feedback e gerenciamento de memória","Integração com Ralph Zero"],"ru":["Создание комплексных технических требований к продукту","Интерактивный рабочий процесс из 5 этапов","Обработка ошибок и планирование процессов","Обучение с помощью обратной связи и управление памятью","Интеграция с Ralph Zero"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج الشاملة والمنظمة","سير عمل تفاعلي من 5 خطوات","تعامل مع الأخطاء وتخطيط العمليات","التعلم من خلال الرد والتحكم في الذاكرة","التكامل مع رالف زيرو"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use prd skill","prd skill alternative","prd setup guide","what is prd skill","prd vs ralph loop","prd installation for ai agents","generate product requirements document","prd skill for autonomous development","interactive prd generation"],"zh":["PRD 生成技能","自动化开发","交互式问答工作流","产品需求文档","Ralph Zero","AI 에이전트","自动化工具"],"ja":["PRD 作成スキル","自動開発","交互式の質問と回答のワークフロー","製品要件文書","Ralph Zero","AI エージェント","自動化ツール"],"ko":["PRD 생성 스킬","자동화 개발","상호작용형 질문과 답변 작업 흐름","제품 요구 사항 문서","Ralph Zero","AI 에이전트","자동화 도구"],"es":["generación de PRD","agentes de IA","Ralph Zero","orquestación de agentes","gestión de errores","programación de procesos","aprendizaje de retroalimentación","creación de historias implementables","desarrollo de productos"],"fr":["création de PRD","outils d''IA","Ralph Zero","orchestration d''agents","gestion des erreurs","planification de processus","apprentissage de rétroaction","création d''histoires implementables","développement de produits"],"de":["Erstellung von PRD","KI-Agents","Ralph Zero","Orchestrierung von Agenten","Fehlermanagement","Prozessplanung","Rückmeldelernen","Erstellung von umsetzbaren Geschichten","Produktentwicklung"],"pt":["PRD","Geração de documentos de requisitos de produto","Desenvolvimento autônomo","Ralph Zero","ИИ Агенты","Documentos de requisitos de produto interativos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты PRD","Создание технических требований к продукту","Интерактивный рабочий процесс","Ralph Zero","Обработка ошибок","Управление памятью"],"ar":["برد","إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج","تنمية مستقلة","رالف زيرو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مستندات متطلبات المنتج الشاملة"]}},"owner":"davidkimai","repo":"ralph-zero","repoPath":"davidkimai/ralph-zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.453Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate structured Product Requirements Documents through guided questions. Creates well-formed PRDs with user stories, acceptance criteria, and technical approach. Use when planning new features, creating specifications, or when user asks to create/generate a PRD.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generation Skill\n\nGenerate comprehensive, structured Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) through an interactive question-and-answer workflow optimized for autonomous development.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- User asks to \"create a PRD\" or \"generate requirements\"\n- Planning a new feature before implementation\n- Need to document requirements for Ralph Zero\n- Want to break down complex features into implementable stories\n\n## Workflow\n\nThis skill follows a structured 5-step proces","body":"# PRD Generation Skill\n\nGenerate comprehensive, structured Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) through an interactive question-and-answer workflow optimized for autonomous development.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- User asks to \"create a PRD\" or \"generate requirements\"\n- Planning a new feature before implementation\n- Need to document requirements for Ralph Zero\n- Want to break down complex features into implementable stories\n\n## Workflow\n\nThis skill follows a structured 5-step process to create production-ready PRDs.\n\n### Step 1: Get Feature Description\n\nAsk the user for a high-level description:\n\n```\nWhat feature would you like to build? Please provide a brief description.\n```\n\n### Step 2: Ask Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk these essential questions with **letter options** for quick responses:\n\n#### 1. Problem & Goals\n```\n1. What problem does this feature solve?\n   A. User pain point / friction\n   B. Business requirement\n   C. Technical debt / refactoring\n   D. Competitive feature parity\n   E. Other: [specify]\n```\n\n#### 2. Target Users\n```\n2. Who will use this feature?\n   A. End users only\n   B. Admin users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Developers / internal team\n   E. External integrations\n```\n\n#### 3. Scope\n```\n3. What is the desired scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version (fastest path)\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Backend/API only (no UI)\n   D. Frontend/UI only (mock backend)\n```\n\n#### 4. Technical Constraints\n```\n4. Any technical constraints or requirements?\n   A. Must integrate with existing system X\n   B. Performance requirements (specify)\n   C. Security/compliance requirements\n   D. No special constraints\n```\n\n#### 5. Success Measurement\n```\n5. How will you measure success?\n   A. User metrics (engagement, retention)\n   B. Business metrics (conversion, revenue)\n   C. Technical metrics (performance, quality)\n   D. Simply: feature works as specified\n```\n\n**Allow user to respond:** `1A, 2C, 3A, 4D, 5D` for efficient iteration.\n\n### Step 3: Generate PRD\n\nBased on answers, generate a PRD using this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 sentence overview]\n\n## Problem Statement\n[What problem are we solving and why]\n\n## Goals\n- Goal 1: [Specific, measurable]\n- Goal 2: [Specific, measurable]\n- Goal 3: [Specific, measurable]\n\n## User Stories\n\nFor each story, use this format:\n\n### US-001: [Story Title]\n**Description:** As a [user type], I want to [action], so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific, verifiable criterion 1\n- [ ] Specific, verifiable criterion 2\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] [UI stories only] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n**Priority:** 1\n\n**Notes:** [Any implementation hints or context]\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: The system must [specific requirement]\n- FR-2: When [condition], the system must [behavior]\n- FR-3: [Specific, testable requirement]\n\n## Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\n\n- What we''re explicitly NOT doing\n- Features deferred to future iterations\n- Edge cases intentionally not handled\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n### Architecture\n[High-level technical approach]\n\n### Data Model\n[Key schema changes or data structures]\n\n### APIs/Inte grations\n[External systems, endpoints needed]\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Metric 1: [target value]\n- Metric 2: [target value]\n\n## Timeline & Milestones\n\n- Phase 1: [description] - [timeframe]\n- Phase 2: [description] - [timeframe]\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Dependency 1: [what and why]\n- Dependency 2: [what and why]\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Question 1\n- Question 2\n```\n\n### Step 4: Save PRD\n\nSave to `tasks/prd-[feature-name-kebab-case].md`\n\nExamples:\n- \"User Authentication\" → `tasks/prd-user-authentication.md`\n- \"Task Priority System\" → `tasks/prd-task-priority.md`\n\n### Step 5: Next Steps\n\nAfter saving, inform the user:\n\n```\n✅ PRD saved to tasks/prd-[feature-name].md\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review and refine the PRD as needed\n2. Convert to prd.json: Load ralph-convert skill and convert tasks/prd-[feature-name].md to prd.json\n3. Run Ralph Zero: ralph-zero run --max-iterations 50\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Keep Stories Atomic\n\nEach user story should be:\n- **Specific**: Clear about what needs to be done\n- **Testable**: Can be verified when complete\n- **Independent**: Minimal dependencies on other stories\n- **Small**: Completable in one iteration (30min - 2hrs)\n\n### Write Verifiable Acceptance Criteria\n\n✅ **Good criteria (specific, testable):**\n- \"Add status column to tasks table (''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'')\"\n- \"Badge shows green for done, blue for in_progress, gray for pending\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog with Cancel/Confirm buttons\"\n\n❌ **Bad criteria (vague, untestable):**\n- \"Status works correctly\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"User can easily do X\"\n- \"Handles all edge cases\"\n\n### Order Stories by Dependency\n\nStories should execute in dependency order:\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes\n2. Backend logic/server actions\n3. UI components\n4. Dashboard/aggregation views\n\n**Wrong order:**\n- UI component at priority 1 that needs schema from priority 3\n\n### Always Include Quality Checks\n\nEvery story must have:\n- `Typecheck passes` as final criterion\n- `Tests pass` if testable logic\n- `Verify in browser using dev-browser skill` if UI changes\n\n## Example Interaction\n\n**User:** \"Create a PRD for adding task priority levels\"\n\n**Agent (you):**\n```\nI''ll help you create a PRD for task priority levels. Let me ask some clarifying questions:\n\n1. What problem does this feature solve?\n   A. User pain point / friction\n   B. Business requirement\n   C. Technical debt / refactoring\n   D. Competitive feature parity\n   E. Other: [specify]\n\n[User: 1A]\n\n2. Who will use this feature?\n   A. End users only\n   B. Admin users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Developers / internal team\n   E. External integrations\n\n[User: 2C]\n\n...\n\n[After gathering all answers]\n\nGreat! Here''s your PRD:\n\n# Task Priority System\n\n## Executive Summary\nAdd priority levels (high, medium, low) to tasks so users can focus on what matters most...\n\n[Generate complete PRD]\n\n✅ PRD saved to tasks/prd-task-priority.md\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review the PRD\n2. Convert to prd.json using ralph-convert skill\n3. Run Ralph Zero\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nFor project-specific templates, create:\n```\nskills/prd/references/CUSTOM_TEMPLATE.md\n```\n\nThen reference it:\n```\nUse the custom PRD template from references/CUSTOM_TEMPLATE.md\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### Avoid Vague Requirements\n❌ \"Make the UI better\"\n✅ \"Add visual feedback on hover (scale to 1.05, show shadow)\"\n\n### Avoid Mixing Concerns\n❌ \"Add authentication and dashboard\"\n✅ Split into: Auth schema, Auth UI, Dashboard\n\n### Avoid Future-Proofing\n❌ \"Design for eventual multi-tenant support\"\n✅ \"Implement single-tenant, document extension points\"\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **ralph-convert**: Convert this PRD to prd.json\n- **ralph-zero**: Run autonomous development loop\n\n## See Also\n\n- [PRD Template](references/TEMPLATE.md)\n- [PRD Best Practices](references/BEST_PRACTICES.md)\n- [Story Sizing Guide](references/STORY_SIZING.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:56:05.831Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation through interactive workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要通过交互式工作流生成结构化产品需求文档的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがインタラクティブなワークフローを通じて構造化された製品要件文書を生成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 상호작용형 워크플로를 통해 구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan generar documentos de Requisitos de Producto estructurados a través de flujos de trabajo interactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de générer des documents de spécifications de produit structurés via des flux de travail interactifs.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente durch interaktive Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração de Documento de Requisitos de Produto estruturado por meio de fluxos de trabalho interativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется структурированная генерация документа требований к продукту через интерактивные рабочие процессы.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد وثيقة متطلبات المنتج المهيكلة من خلال سير عمل تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive Product Requirements Documents using interactive question-and-answer workflows, optimizing autonomous development and feature planning with structured PRD generation.","zh":"赋予代理生成综合产品需求文档的能力，通过交互式问答工作流，优化自主开发和功能规划，实现结构化的 PRD 生成。","ja":"エージェントがインタラクティブな質問と回答のワークフローを使用して包括的な製品要件文書を生成できるようにし、自主的な開発と機能計画を最適化し、構造化された PRD 生成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 상호작용형 질문과 답변 워크플로를 통해 포괄적인 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 자율적인 개발과 기능 계획을 최적화하고 구조화된 PRD 생성을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de Requisitos de Producto completos utilizando flujos de trabajo interactivos de preguntas y respuestas, optimizando el desarrollo autónomo y la planificación de funciones con la generación estructurada de PRD.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de spécifications de produit complets en utilisant des flux de travail interactifs de questions et réponses, en optimisant le développement autonome et la planification de fonctions avec la génération structurée de PRD.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Produktanforderungsdokumente mithilfe interaktiver Frage-und-Antwort-Workflows zu generieren, optimiert autonomes Entwicklung und Funktionsplanung mit strukturierter PRD-Generierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos abrangentes de Requisitos de Produto usando fluxos de trabalho interativos de perguntas e respostas, otimizando o desenvolvimento autônomo e o planejamento de recursos com geração de PRD estruturada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать всесторонние документы требований к продукту, используя интерактивные рабочие процессы вопросов и ответов, оптимизируя автономное развитие и планирование функций с структурированной генерацией PRD.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد وثائق شاملة لمتطلبات المنتج باستخدام سير عمل تفاعلية للأسئلة والإجابات، وتحسين التطوير المستقل وتخطيط الميزات مع توليد وثيقة متطلبات المنتج المهيكلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementation","Breaking down complex features into implementable stories","Documenting requirements for project planning"],"zh":["为新功能实现生成 PRD","将复杂功能分解为可实施的故事","记录项目规划的要求"],"ja":["新しい機能の実装のための PRD を生成する","複雑な機能を実装可能なストーリーに分解する","プロジェクト計画の要件を文書化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 PRD 생성","복잡한 기능을 구현 가능한 스토리로 분해","프로젝트 계획을 위한 요구 사항 문서화"],"es":["Generar PRD para la implementación de nuevas características","Descomponer características complejas en historias implementables","Documentar requisitos para la planificación de proyectos"],"fr":["Générer des PRD pour la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Décomposer des fonctionnalités complexes en histoires implementables","Documenter les exigences pour la planification de projets"],"de":["PRD für die Implementierung neuer Funktionen generieren","Komplexe Funktionen in umsetzbare Geschichten aufteilen","Anforderungen für die Projektplanung dokumentieren"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para implementação de novos recursos","Divisão de recursos complexos em histórias implementáveis","Documentação de requisitos para planejamento de projetos"],"ru":["Генерация PRD для внедрения новых функций","Разделение сложных функций на реализуемые истории","Документирование требований для планирования проектов"],"ar":["توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج لتنفيذ ميزات جديدة","تقسيم الميزات المعقدة إلى قصص قابلة للتنفيذ","توثيق المتطلبات لتخطيط المشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires interactive user input","Optimized for autonomous development and planning new features"],"zh":["需要交互式用户输入","优化自主开发和新功能规划"],"ja":["インタラクティブなユーザー入力を必要とする","自主的な開発と新しい機能の計画に最適化"],"ko":["상호작용형 사용자 입력이 필요","자율적인 개발과 새로운 기능 계획에 최적화"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario interactiva","Optimizado para desarrollo autónomo y planificación de nuevas características"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur interactive","Optimisé pour le développement autonome et la planification de nouvelles fonctionnalités"],"de":["Benötigt interaktive Benutzereingabe","Optimiert für autonomes Entwicklung und Planung neuer Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige entrada interativa do usuário","Otimizado para desenvolvimento autônomo e planejamento de novos recursos"],"ru":["Требует интерактивного ввода пользователя","Оптимизирован для автономного развития и планирования новых функций"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال تفاعلي للمستخدم","مُحسّن لتنمية مستقلة وتخطيط ميزات جديدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"83ea93fc1dd955868057bbd8fe2aa6c25a94f67fde40b749de1dce7a62410b2d","qualityScore":59}');
