,"de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Git-Workflow","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Fluxo de Trabalho Git","ru":"Настройка Потока Работы Git: Лучшие Практики","ar":"إعداد Fluxo de Trabalho Git: أداة إدارة المشاريع"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient Git workflow management with standardized commit messages - learn how to implement the perfect format and boost collaboration","zh":"了解 Git 工作流的最佳实践，包括提交消息格式和类型，优化您的代码管理流程","ja":"Git ワークフローのベストプラクティスを学び、コード管理を効率化しよう。AIエージェントによるサポートも","ko":"Git 워크플로우의 핵심을 알아보세요. 효율적인 코드 관리를 위한提交 메시지 형식과 유형에 대한 가이드","es":"Aprende a configurar y utilizar el flujo de trabajo Git de manera efectiva con nuestros patrones y mejores prácticas","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer et utiliser efficacement le flux de travail Git avec nos modèles et meilleures pratiques","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Git-Workflow effektiv konfigurieren und verwenden können, mit unseren Mustern und Best Practices","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o fluxo de trabalho Git para melhorar a colaboração e a produtividade da sua equipe de desenvolvimento","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить поток работы Git для улучшения сотрудничества и производительности вашей команды разработчиков","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد Fluxo de Trabalho Git لتحسين التعاون والإنتاجية لفريق التطوير الخاص بك"},"definition":{"en":"git-workflow is a standardized approach to managing Git commits through a specific message format, enhancing code maintainability and team collaboration","zh":"Git 工作流是一种代码管理方法，定义了提交消息的格式和类型","ja":"Git ワークフローは、コード管理方法の一種で、コミットメッセージの形式やタイプを定義します","ko":"Git 워크플로우는 코드 관리 방법 중 하나로, 커밋 메시지의 형식과 유형을 정의합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es un conjunto de patrones y convenciones para gestionar cambios en el código","fr":"Le flux de travail Git est un ensemble de modèles et de conventions pour gérer les modifications de code","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist eine Sammlung von Mustern und Konventionen zur Verwaltung von Code-Änderungen","pt":"Fluxo de trabalho Git é um conjunto de padrões para commits que facilita a colaboração e a manutenção do código","ru":"Поток работы Git - это набор шаблонов для коммитов, который облегчает сотрудничество и поддержку кода","ar":"Fluxo de Trabalho Git هو مجموعة من الأنماط لإلتزامات التي تسهل التعاون وصيانة الكود"},"features":{"en":["Enforces a consistent commit message format using type, scope, subject, body, and footer","Supports multiple commit types, including feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, and chore","Improves code readability through clear and descriptive commit messages","Enhances team collaboration by establishing a shared understanding of commit message conventions","Facilitates the use of automated tools and scripts to parse and analyze commit messages"],"zh":["提交消息格式：<type>(<scope>): <subject> <body> <footer>","提交类型：feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、chore","代码管理优化","效率提升","标准化提交消息"],"ja":["コミットメッセージ形式：<type>(<scope>): <subject> <body> <footer>","コミットタイプ：feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、chore","コード管理の効率化","生産性の向上","標準化されたコミットメッセージ"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 형식：<type>(<scope>): <subject> <body> <footer>","커밋 유형：feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、chore","코드 관리 효율화","생산성 향상","표준화된 커밋 메시지"],"es":["Patrones de mensaje de commit como feat, fix y docs","Estructura de mensaje de commit con tipo, alcance y asunto","Mejora de la colaboración con convenciones de nomenclatura","Soporte para refactor, perf, test y chore","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como CLI y Git"],"fr":["Modèles de message de commit tels que feat, fix et docs","Structure de message de commit avec type, portée et sujet","Amélioration de la collaboration avec des conventions de nommage","Prise en charge de refactor, perf, test et chore","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que CLI et Git"],"de":["Muster für Commit-Mitteilungen wie feat, fix und docs","Struktur von Commit-Mitteilungen mit Typ, Umfang und Betreff","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit durch Namenskonventionen","Unterstützung für refactor, perf, test und chore","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie CLI und Git"],"pt":["Padrão de commits com tipo, escopo e assunto","Tipos de commits: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test e chore","Formatação de mensagens de commit com corpo e rodapé","Organização de commits com scopes e tipos","Melhoria da colaboração e produtividade da equipe"],"ru":["Шаблон коммитов с типом, объёмом и темой","Типы коммитов: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test и chore","Форматирование сообщений коммитов с телом и подвалом","Организация коммитов с объёмами и типами","Улучшение сотрудничества и производительности команды"],"ar":["نمط إلتزامات مع نوع، نطاق و موضوع","أنواع الإلتزامات: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test و chore","تنسيق رسائل الإلتزامات مع جسم و تذييل","تنظيم الإلتزامات مع نطاقات و أنواع","تحسين التعاون والإنتاجية لفريق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["git-workflow setup guide","commit message format best practices","git workflow management tools","standardized commit messages","git-workflow vs git-flow","how to use git-workflow","git-workflow installation","git workflow automation","git commit message conventions","improving code readability with git-workflow"],"zh":["Git 工作流","代码管理","提交消息格式","提交类型","代码优化","效率提升","标准化提交消息","AI工具","代码管理工具"],"ja":["Git ワークフロー","コード管理","コミットメッセージ形式","コミットタイプ","コード最適化","効率化","標準化されたコミットメッセージ","AIエージェント","コード管理ツール"],"ko":["Git 워크플로우","코드 관리","커밋 메시지 형식","커밋 유형","코드 최적화","효율화","표준화된 커밋 메시지","AI 도구","코드 관리 도구"],"es":["flujo de trabajo git","patrones de commit","colaboración en git","mejores prácticas git","herramientas de desarrollo git","git workflow","commit patterns","git collaboration","git best practices"],"fr":["flux de travail git","modèles de commit","collaboration git","meilleures pratiques git","outils de développement git","git workflow","commit patterns","git collaboration","git best practices"],"de":["git-workflow","commit-muster","git-zusammenarbeit","git-best-practices","entwicklungstools git","git workflow","commit patterns","git collaboration","git best practices"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho git","padrão de commits","tipos de commits","formatação de mensagens de commit","colaboração em equipe","produtividade de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","git workflow","commit message format"],"ru":["поток работы git","шаблон коммитов","типы коммитов","форматирование сообщений коммитов","сотрудничество в команде","производительность разработки","инструменты разработки","git workflow","commit message format"],"ar":["fluxo de trabalho git","نمط إلتزامات","أنواع الإلتزامات","تنسيق رسائل الإلتزامات","تعاون فريق التطوير","إنتاجية التطوير","أدوات التطوير","git workflow","commit message format"]}},"owner":"cooldaemon","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"cooldaemon/dotfiles","stars":13,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:55Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":"Git workflow patterns including commit messages, rebase strategy, and pre-commit hooks. Use when committing, creating PRs, or managing git history.","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow Patterns\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n<body>\n\n<footer>\n```\n\n### Types\n\n| Type | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| feat | New feature implementation |\n| fix | Bug fixes |\n| docs | Documentation changes only |\n| style | Code formatting, missing semicolons, etc. |\n| refactor | Code restructuring without behavior changes |\n| perf | Performance improvements |\n| test | Test additions or corrections |\n| chore | Build process, auxiliary tools, dependenci","body":"# Git Workflow Patterns\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n<body>\n\n<footer>\n```\n\n### Types\n\n| Type | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| feat | New feature implementation |\n| fix | Bug fixes |\n| docs | Documentation changes only |\n| style | Code formatting, missing semicolons, etc. |\n| refactor | Code restructuring without behavior changes |\n| perf | Performance improvements |\n| test | Test additions or corrections |\n| chore | Build process, auxiliary tools, dependencies |\n\n### Rules\n\n- Subject line: Max 50 characters, imperative mood, no period\n- Body: Wrap at 72 characters, explain WHY not WHAT\n- Write in English\n- Be specific and descriptive\n\n### Examples\n\n```\nfeat(auth): add OAuth2 integration with Google\n\nImplemented Google OAuth2 authentication flow to allow users\nto sign in with their Google accounts. This includes:\n- OAuth2 configuration and middleware setup\n- User profile synchronization\n- Session management with JWT tokens\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n```\nfix(api): resolve race condition in payment processing\n\nThe payment webhook handler was not properly locking the\ntransaction record, causing duplicate charges when webhooks\narrived simultaneously. Added database-level locking to\nensure atomic transaction updates.\n```\n\n## Pre-commit Hook Handling\n\n**CRITICAL: NEVER use `--no-verify` flag**\n\n### Language-specific Checks\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript:**\n- Linting: `npm run lint`, `eslint`\n- Type checking: `npm run typecheck`, `tsc`\n- Formatting: `prettier --check`, `npm run format`\n- Tests: `npm test`, `jest`, `vitest`\n\n**Python:**\n- Linting: `ruff check`, `flake8`, `pylint`\n- Type checking: `mypy`, `pyright`\n- Formatting: `black --check`, `ruff format`\n- Tests: `pytest`, `python -m unittest`\n\n**Ruby:**\n- Linting: `rubocop`\n- Tests: `rspec`, `rake test`\n\n**Go:**\n- Formatting: `go fmt`, `gofmt`\n- Linting: `golangci-lint run`\n- Tests: `go test`\n\n**General:**\n- See `makefile-first` skill for command execution policy\n- Check package.json scripts section\n- Review project documentation\n\n### Fixing Pre-commit Failures\n\n1. Analyze the error message\n2. Fix automatically if possible (formatting, linting)\n3. For type errors: Modify code to fix\n4. For test failures: Debug and fix\n5. Stage fixed files and retry commit\n\n## Rebase Strategy\n\n### When to Rebase\n\nUse `git pull --rebase` to maintain linear history:\n- Before pushing local commits\n- When local branch is behind remote\n\n### How Rebase Works\n\n1. Fetches remote changes\n2. Temporarily removes your local commits\n3. Applies remote commits to your branch\n4. Re-applies your local commits on top\n5. Creates linear history without merge commits\n\n### Conflict Resolution\n\nWhen conflicts occur:\n1. `git status` to identify conflicted files\n2. Resolve each conflict (ours/theirs/manual)\n3. Remove conflict markers (`<<<<<<<`, `=======`, `>>>>>>>`)\n4. `git add` resolved files\n5. `git rebase --continue`\n6. Or `git rebase --abort` to give up\n\n## Safety Checks\n\nBefore git operations:\n- **Uncommitted changes**: Stash or commit before proceeding\n- **Remote tracking**: Ensure branch tracks a remote\n- **Network connectivity**: Verify connection to remote\n- **Branch protection**: Check if branch has push restrictions\n\n## Error Handling Patterns\n\n**No remote tracking:**\n```bash\ngit branch --set-upstream-to=origin/branch-name\n```\n\n**Uncommitted changes:**\n```bash\n# Option 1: Stash changes\ngit stash push -m \"Temporary stash for rebase\"\n# ... perform rebase ...\ngit stash pop\n\n# Option 2: Commit changes first\n```\n\n**Network issues:**\n- Retry with clear error messages\n- Check remote URL with `git remote -v`\n- Verify credentials if authentication fails\n\n## Pull Request Workflow\n\n1. Analyze full commit history (not just latest commit)\n2. Use `git diff [base-branch]...HEAD` to see all changes\n3. Draft comprehensive PR summary\n4. Include test plan with TODOs\n5. Push with `-u` flag if new branch\n\n## Git Fixup Pattern\n\nDuring TDD, each User Story produces a clean commit history through fixup commits:\n\n1. **After GREEN phase**: Create a semantic commit\n   ```bash\n   git add -A && git commit -m \"feat(scope): description\"\n   ```\n\n2. **After REFACTOR phase**: Create a fixup commit targeting the GREEN commit\n   ```bash\n   git add -A && git commit --fixup HEAD\n   ```\n\n3. **After review fixes**: Create a fixup commit targeting the relevant US commit\n   ```bash\n   git add -A && git commit --fixup <target-sha>\n   ```\n\n4. **Before push**: Autosquash all fixup commits\n   ```bash\n   GIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR=true git rebase --autosquash origin/<base-branch>\n   ```\n\nThe result is one clean commit per US in the final history.\n\n### Interleaved Commits\n\nGit `fixup!` commits match their target by **commit message**, not by position in the log. This means interleaved normal and fixup commits from multiple USs are correctly handled by autosquash.\n\n**Before autosquash:**\n```\nfeat(auth): add login flow              <- US-1 GREEN\nfixup! feat(auth): add login flow       <- US-1 REFACTOR\nfixup! feat(auth): add login flow       <- US-1 review fix\nfeat(auth): add password reset          <- US-2 GREEN\nfixup! feat(auth): add password reset   <- US-2 REFACTOR\n```\n\n**After `git rebase --autosquash`:**\n```\nfeat(auth): add login flow              <- US-1 (REFACTOR + fix absorbed)\nfeat(auth): add password reset          <- US-2 (REFACTOR absorbed)\n```\n\nEach fixup is absorbed into the commit whose message it matches, regardless of intervening commits.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:49:12.747Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Management Agents seeking to enforce standardized commit message formats and streamline Git workflows.","zh":"适合于寻求强制执行标准化提交消息格式和简化 Git 工作流的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式を強制し、Git ワークフローを簡素化したい場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 관리 에이전트가 표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 적용하고 Git 워크플ロー를 간소화하려는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de código que buscan hacer cumplir formatos de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados y optimizar flujos de trabajo de Git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de code souhaitant appliquer des formats de messages de validation standardisés et rationaliser les flux de travail Git.","de":"Ideal für Code-Management-Agents, die standardisierte Commit-Mitteilungsformate durchsetzen und Git-Workflows optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que buscam impor formatos de mensagem de commit padronizados e otimizar fluxos de trabalho do Git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления кодом, стремящихся обеспечить стандартизированные форматы сообщений о фиксации и оптимизировать рабочие процессы Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الكود الذي يسعى إلى فرض تنسيقات رسائل الإلتزام الموحدة وتسهيل سير عمل جيت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a consistent commit message format, utilizing types such as feat, fix, and docs, to improve code organization and readability, and streamline Git workflow processes through standardized scope and subject specifications.","zh":"赋予代理执行一致的提交消息格式的能力，利用诸如 feat、fix 和 docs 之类的类型，以提高代码组织性和可读性，并通过标准化的范围和主题规范简化 Git 工作流过程。","ja":"エージェントが一貫したコミットメッセージ形式を強制する能力を付与し、feat、fix、docs などのタイプを使用してコードの組織性と可読性を向上させ、標準化されたスコープとサブジェクトの仕様を通じて Git ワークフロープロセスを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 일관된 커밋 메시지 형식을 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 feat, fix, docs 등의 유형을 사용하여 코드의 조직성과 가독성을 향상시키고, 표준화된 범위와 주제 사양을 통해 Git 워크플ロー 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un formato de mensaje de confirmación coherente, utilizando tipos como feat, fix y docs, para mejorar la organización y legibilidad del código, y racionalizar los procesos de flujo de trabajo de Git a través de especificaciones de alcance y asunto estandarizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un format de message de validation cohérent, en utilisant des types tels que feat, fix et docs, pour améliorer l''organisation et la lisibilité du code, et rationaliser les processus de flux de travail Git grâce à des spécifications de portée et de sujet standardisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein konsistentes Commit-Mitteilungsformat durchzusetzen, unter Verwendung von Typen wie feat, fix und docs, um die Codeorganisation und Lesbarkeit zu verbessern und Git-Workflows durch standardisierte Bereichs- und Betreffangaben zu rationalisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um formato de mensagem de commit consistente, utilizando tipos como feat, fix e docs, para melhorar a organização e legibilidade do código e otimizar os processos de fluxo de trabalho do Git por meio de especificações de escopo e assunto padronizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить последовательный формат сообщения о фиксации, используя типы, такие как feat, fix и docs, для улучшения организации и читаемости кода, а также оптимизации процессов рабочего потока Git посредством стандартизированных спецификаций области и темы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض تنسيق رسائل الإلتزام الثابت، باستخدام أنواع مثل feat و fix و docs، لتحسين تنظيم الكود وقراءته وتسهيل عمليات سير عمل جيت من خلال مواصفات النطاق والموضوع المعيارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message formatting","Enforcing standardized Git workflow patterns","Generating commit messages with specific types and scopes"],"zh":["自动化提交消息格式","强制执行标准化的 Git 工作流模式","生成具有特定类型和范围的提交消息"],"ja":["コミットメッセージ形式の自動化","標準化された Git ワークフローパターンの強制","特定のタイプとスコープを持つコミットメッセージの生成"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 형식 자동화","표준화된 Git 워크플ロー 패턴 적용","특정 유형 및 범위가 있는 커밋 메시지 생성"],"es":["Automatización del formato de mensaje de confirmación","Aplicación de patrones de flujo de trabajo de Git estandarizados","Generación de mensajes de confirmación con tipos y alcances específicos"],"fr":["Automatisation du formatage des messages de validation","Application de modèles de flux de travail Git standardisés","Génération de messages de validation avec des types et des portées spécifiques"],"de":["Automatisierung des Commit-Mitteilungsformates","Durchsetzung standardisierter Git-Workflow-Muster","Erzeugung von Commit-Mitteilungen mit spezifischen Typen und Bereichen"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de mensagens de commit","Impor padrões de fluxo de trabalho do Git padronizados","Gerar mensagens de commit com tipos e escopos específicos"],"ru":["Автоматизация форматирования сообщений о фиксации","Принуждение к соблюдению стандартизированных шаблонов рабочего потока Git","Генерация сообщений о фиксации с конкретными типами и областями"],"ar":["توفير تنسيق تلقائي لرسائل الإلتزام","فرض أنماط سير عمل جيت معيارية","توليد رسائل إلتزام بالأنواع والنطاقات المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git integration","Limited to specific commit message format","Dependent on developer adherence to standardized workflow"],"zh":["需要 Git 集成","仅限于特定的提交消息格式","依赖于开发人员对标准化工作流的遵守"],"ja":["Git 統合が必要","特定のコミットメッセージ形式に限定される","開発者の標準化されたワークフローへの遵守に依存する"],"ko":["Git 통합이 필요","특정 커밋 메시지 형식으로 제한","개발자의 표준화된 워크플로에 대한 순응에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con Git","Limitado a un formato de mensaje de confirmación específico","Dependiente del cumplimiento de los desarrolladores con respecto al flujo de trabajo estandarizado"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Git","Limité à un format de message de validation spécifique","Dépend de l''adhésion des développeurs à un flux de travail standardisé"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Integration","Begrenzt auf ein bestimmtes Commit-Mitteilungsformat","Abhängig von der Einhaltung der standardisierten Workflow-Richtlinien durch die Entwickler"],"pt":["Exige integração com o Git","Limitado a um formato de mensagem de commit específico","Dependente da adesão do desenvolvedor a um fluxo de trabalho padronizado"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Git","Ограничен конкретным форматом сообщения о фиксации","Зависит от соблюдения разработчиком стандартизированного рабочего потока"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع جيت","محدود بتنسيق رسائل الإلتزام المعين","يعتمد على اتباع المطور لسير عمل معياري"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c456e267df378e95a373f2628fc654d5cfcf6958a8a4f93174663354c9f22f67","qualityScore":57}');
