MADR-Vorlage von o3-cloud verwendet","pt":"ADR é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para criar registros de decisão de arquitetura com o modelo MADR","ru":"ADR - это ИИ Агент для создания Architecture Decision Records с помощью шаблона MADR","ar":"ADR هو أداة سطر الأوامر لإنشاء سجلات قرارات Архитектур باستخدام نموذج MADR"},"features":{"en":["Generates comprehensive Architecture Decision Records using the MADR template","Asks for key information to document architectural decisions","Determines the ADR number for organization and tracking","Supports AI-driven decision making with the o3-cloud/madr template","Creates structured records of problems, options, and decisions made"],"zh":["使用 MADR 模板创建全面的架构决策记录","提供创建 ADR 的步骤指南","支持命令行界面（CLI）","可以记录架构决策和问题解决过程"],"ja":["MADR テンプレートを使用して包括的なアーキテクチャ決定レコードを作成","ADR 作成のステップバイステップガイドを提供","コマンドラインインターフェース（CLI）をサポート","アーキテクチャ決定と問題解決プロセスを記録可能"],"ko":["MADR 템플릿을 사용하여 포괄적인 아키텍처 결정 기록을 생성","ADR 생성의 단계별 가이드를 제공","명령줄 인터페이스（CLI）를 지원","아키텍처 결정과 문제 해결 프로세스를 기록할 수 있음"],"es":["Uso de la plantilla MADR de o3-cloud","Creación de registros de decisiones de arquitectura","Solicitud de información clave para la toma de decisiones","Determinación del número de registro de decisión"],"fr":["Utilisation du modèle MADR de o3-cloud","Création d''enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","Demande d''informations clés pour la prise de décision","Détermination du numéro d''enregistrement de décision"],"de":["Verwendung der MADR-Vorlage von o3-cloud","Erstellung von Architekturentscheidungsprotokollen","Anfrage von Schlüsselinformationen für die Entscheidungsfindung","Festlegung der Entscheidungsprotokollnummer"],"pt":["Criação de registros de decisão de arquitetura com o modelo MADR","Ferramenta de linha de comando para documentar decisões arquiteturais","Perguntas para coletar informações-chave sobre a decisão arquitetural","Determinação do número do registro de decisão de arquitetura","Integração com o modelo MADR da o3-cloud"],"ru":["Создание Architecture Decision Records с помощью шаблона MADR","ИИ Агент для документирования решений по архитектуре","Вопросы для сбора ключевой информации о решении по архитектуре","Определение номера Architecture Decision Record","Интеграция с шаблоном MADR от o3-cloud"],"ar":["إنشاء سجلات قرارات Архитектур باستخدام نموذج MADR","أداة سطر الأوامر لتوثيق القرارات المعمارية","اسئلة لجمع المعلومات الرئيسية حول القرار المعماري","تحديد رقم سجل القرار المعماري","التكامل مع نموذج MADR من o3-cloud"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use adr","what is adr","adr setup guide","adr alternative","adr vs madr","adr install","adr template","architecture decision record","madr template"],"zh":["ADR 创建","MADR 模板","架构决策记录","CLI 工具","AI 에이전트","开发者工具"],"ja":["ADR 作成","MADR テンプレート","アーキテクチャ決定レコード","CLI ツール","AI エージェント","開発者ツール"],"ko":["ADR 생성","MADR 템플릿","아키텍처 결정 기록","CLI 도구","AI 에이전트","개발자 도구"],"es":["ADR","Registro de decisiones de arquitectura","Herramientas de línea de comandos","Plantilla MADR","o3-cloud","Desarrollo de software","Arquitectura de software"],"fr":["ADR","Enregistrement de décisions d''architecture","Outils de ligne de commande","Modèle MADR","o3-cloud","Développement de logiciels","Architecture de logiciels"],"de":["ADR","Architekturentscheidungsprotokoll","Kommandozeilen-Tools","MADR-Vorlage","o3-cloud","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Architektur"],"pt":["ADR","registros de decisão de arquitetura","ferramentas de linha de comando","MADR","o3-cloud","desenvolvimento de software","arquitetura de software"],"ru":["ADR","ИИ Агенты","Architecture Decision Records","CLLM","MADR","o3-cloud","разработка программного обеспечения","архитектура программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ADR","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","سجلات قرارات Архитектур","CLLM","MADR","o3-cloud","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"cmd-llm","repo":"cllm","repoPath":"cmd-llm/cllm","stars":8,"forks":3,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T09:57:54Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"adr","description":"Creates Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) using the AI-driven MADR template. Use this when the user wants to document architectural decisions, create ADRs, or record technical design choices.","bodyPreview":"# ADR (Architecture Decision Record) Creator\n\nThis skill helps create comprehensive Architecture Decision Records using the AI-driven MADR template from o3-cloud/madr.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen creating an ADR, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Ask for key information** if not provided:\n   - What architectural decision needs to be documented?\n   - What problem are you trying to solve?\n   - What options have you considered?\n   - What decision was made (or needs to be made)?\n\n2. **Determine the ADR number**:","body":"# ADR (Architecture Decision Record) Creator\n\nThis skill helps create comprehensive Architecture Decision Records using the AI-driven MADR template from o3-cloud/madr.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen creating an ADR, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Ask for key information** if not provided:\n   - What architectural decision needs to be documented?\n   - What problem are you trying to solve?\n   - What options have you considered?\n   - What decision was made (or needs to be made)?\n\n2. **Determine the ADR number**:\n   - Check for existing ADRs in `docs/decisions/` or similar directories\n   - Use the next sequential number (e.g., if last ADR is 0003, use 0004)\n\n3. **Create the ADR file** with the naming pattern: `XXXX-short-title.md` (where XXXX is the zero-padded number)\n\n4. **Fill in all relevant sections** of the template below, adapting based on the information provided\n\n5. **Ask clarifying questions** for any sections that need more detail\n\n## ADR Template Structure\n\nUse this template when creating ADRs:\n\n```markdown\n# {short title of solved problem and solution}\n\n## Context and Problem Statement\n\n{Describe the context and problem statement, e.g., in free form using two to three sentences or in the form of an illustrative story.}\n\n## Decision Drivers\n\n- {decision driver 1, e.g., a force, facing concern, …}\n- {decision driver 2, e.g., a force, facing concern, …}\n- … <!-- numbers of drivers can vary -->\n\n## Considered Options\n\n- {title of option 1}\n- {title of option 2}\n- {title of option 3}\n- … <!-- numbers of options can vary -->\n\n## Decision Outcome\n\nChosen option: \"{title of option 1}\", because {justification. e.g., only option, which meets k.o. criterion decision driver | which resolves force {force} | … | comes out best (see below)}.\n\n### Consequences\n\n- Good, because {positive consequence, e.g., improvement of one or more desired qualities, …}\n- Bad, because {negative consequence, e.g., compromising one or more desired qualities, …}\n- … <!-- numbers of consequences can vary -->\n\n### Confirmation\n\n{Describe how the implementation of this ADR will be validated. This could include fitness functions, metrics to monitor, or specific design reviews.}\n\n## Pros and Cons of the Options\n\n### {title of option 1}\n\n{example | description | pointer to more information | …}\n\n- Good, because {argument a}\n- Good, because {argument b}\n- Neutral, because {argument c}\n- Bad, because {argument d}\n- … <!-- numbers of pros and cons can vary -->\n\n### {title of option 2}\n\n{example | description | pointer to more information | …}\n\n- Good, because {argument a}\n- Good, because {argument b}\n- Neutral, because {argument c}\n- Bad, because {argument d}\n- … <!-- numbers of pros and cons can vary -->\n\n### {title of option 3}\n\n{example | description | pointer to more information | …}\n\n- Good, because {argument a}\n- Good, because {argument b}\n- Neutral, because {argument c}\n- Bad, because {argument d}\n- … <!-- numbers of pros and cons can vary -->\n\n## More Information\n\n{You might want to provide additional evidence/confidence for the decision outcome here and/or document the team agreement on the decision and/or define when this decision when and how the decision should be realized and if/when it should be re-visited and/or how the decision is validated. Links to other decisions and resources might here appear as well.}\n\n---\n\n## AI-Specific Extensions\n\n### AI Guidance Level\n\n{Specify how much autonomy AI agents have when implementing this decision:}\n\n- **Strict**: Follow the decision exactly as specified with minimal deviation\n- **Flexible**: Adapt implementation details while maintaining core principles\n- **Exploratory**: Research and propose alternative approaches if better options emerge\n\n{Chosen level: [strict|flexible|exploratory]}\n\n### AI Tool Preferences\n\n{Document which AI systems should execute this decision and their configuration:}\n\n- Preferred AI tools: {e.g., Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, etc.}\n- Model parameters: {e.g., temperature, max tokens, etc.}\n- Special instructions: {any specific guidance for AI tools}\n\n### Test Expectations\n\n{Define validation criteria that should be met (TDD-oriented):}\n\n- {Expected test 1}\n- {Expected test 2}\n- {Performance criteria}\n- {Quality metrics}\n\n### Dependencies\n\n{List related ADRs, system components, and external requirements:}\n\n- Related ADRs: {links to other ADRs}\n- System components: {affected modules, services, etc.}\n- External dependencies: {libraries, services, APIs, etc.}\n\n### Timeline\n\n{Implementation deadlines and review dates:}\n\n- Implementation deadline: {date}\n- First review: {date}\n- Revision triggers: {conditions that would require revisiting this decision}\n\n### Risk Assessment\n\n{Identify and assess risks:}\n\n#### Technical Risks\n\n- {Risk 1}: {description and mitigation strategy}\n- {Risk 2}: {description and mitigation strategy}\n\n#### Business Risks\n\n- {Risk 1}: {description and mitigation strategy}\n- {Risk 2}: {description and mitigation strategy}\n\n### Human Review\n\n{Specify approval requirements:}\n\n- Review required: {before implementation | after implementation | both}\n- Reviewers: {list of required approvers}\n- Approval criteria: {what needs to be verified}\n\n### Feedback Log\n\n{Post-implementation notes - fill this out after implementation:}\n\n- Implementation date: {date}\n- Actual outcomes: {what actually happened}\n- Challenges encountered: {issues faced}\n- Lessons learned: {organizational learning}\n- Suggested improvements: {for future similar decisions}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep it concise**: ADRs should be readable in 5-10 minutes\n2. **Focus on \"why\"**: Explain the reasoning, not just what was decided\n3. **Document alternatives**: Show what was considered and why it wasn''t chosen\n4. **Update when needed**: If a decision is superseded, link to the new ADR\n5. **Use clear language**: Avoid jargon; make it accessible to future team members\n6. **AI sections are optional**: Only fill in AI-specific sections if relevant to the decision\n\n## Example Usage\n\n**User request**: \"Create an ADR for choosing PostgreSQL as our database\"\n\n**Your response should**:\n\n1. Find the next ADR number\n2. Create a file like `docs/decisions/0005-use-postgresql-for-primary-database.md`\n3. Fill in the template with relevant information\n4. Ask for any missing details (e.g., \"What other databases did you consider?\", \"What are the main decision drivers?\")\n\n## Notes\n\n- ADRs are typically stored in `docs/decisions/` directories\n- If no directory exists, ask the user where to create it\n- ADRs are immutable once accepted - don''t edit old ADRs, create new ones that supersede them\n- The AI-specific sections are extensions to the standard MADR template for AI-assisted development\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:49:20.917Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing structured documentation of architectural decisions using the MADR template.","zh":"非常适合需要使用MADR模板对架构决策进行结构化文档记录的开发者代理。","ja":"MADRテンプレートを使用してアーキテクチャの意思決定を構造化されたドキュメントで記録する必要がある開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"MADR 템플릿을 사용하여 아키텍처 결정에 대한 구조화된 문서화가 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan documentación estructurada de decisiones arquitectónicas utilizando la plantilla MADR.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''une documentation structurée des décisions architecturales en utilisant le modèle MADR.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die strukturierte Dokumentationen von Architekturentscheidungen unter Verwendung der MADR-Vorlage benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de documentação estruturada de decisões arquiteturais usando o modelo MADR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуется структурированная документация архитектурных решений с использованием шаблона MADR.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق متكامل للقرارات المعمارية باستخدام قالب MADR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive Architecture Decision Records by documenting problems, solutions, and decisions using the AI-driven MADR template, facilitating informed decision-making and knowledge sharing through standardized ADRs.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面架构决策记录的能力，通过AI驱动的MADR模板记录问题、解决方案和决策，促进知情决策和知识共享，通过标准化的ADR实现。","ja":"エージェントに、AI駆動のMADRテンプレートを使用して問題、解決策、意思決定を文書化することで、包括的なアーキテクチャの意思決定レコードを作成する能力を与え、情報に基づいた意思決定と知識の共有を促進し、標準化されたADRを介して実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 AI 구동 MADR 템플릿을 사용하여 문제, 해결책 및 결정 사항을 문서화하여 포괄적인 아키텍처 결정 기록을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 정보에 기반한 결정과 지식 공유를 촉진하고 표준화된 ADR를 통해 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear Registros de Decisiones de Arquitectura (ADR) integrales documentando problemas, soluciones y decisiones utilizando la plantilla MADR impulsada por IA, facilitando la toma de decisiones informadas y el intercambio de conocimientos a través de ADR estandarizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des Registres de Décisions d''Architecture (ADR) complets en documentant les problèmes, les solutions et les décisions en utilisant le modèle MADR propulsé par l''IA, facilitant la prise de décisions éclairées et le partage des connaissances via des ADR standardisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Architekturentscheidungssätze (ADR) zu erstellen, indem Probleme, Lösungen und Entscheidungen unter Verwendung der künstlich intelligente MADR-Vorlage dokumentiert werden, wodurch eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung und Wissensaustausch durch standardisierte ADR erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar Registros de Decisões de Arquitetura abrangentes, documentando problemas, soluções e decisões usando o modelo MADR impulsionado por IA, facilitando a tomada de decisões informadas e o compartilhamento de conhecimentos por meio de ADRs padronizados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать комплексные Записи архитектурных решений, документируя проблемы, решения и решения с использованием шаблона MADR, управляемого ИИ, что облегчает принятие обоснованных решений и обмен знаниями посредством стандартизированных АР.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء سجلات قرارات معمارية شاملة من خلال توثيق المشكلات والحلول والقرارات باستخدام قالب MADR الموجه بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يسهل اتخاذ القرارات المستنيرة ومشاركة المعرفة من خلال سجلات القرارات المعمارية الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting architectural decisions for cloud-based projects","Generating ADRs for microservices architecture","Standardizing solution documentation across development teams"],"zh":["为基于云的项目记录架构决策","为微服务架构生成ADR","在开发团队内标准化解决方案文档"],"ja":["クラウドベースのプロジェクトのアーキテクチャの意思決定を文書化する","マイクロサービスアーキテクチャのADRを生成する","開発チーム全体でソリューションの文書化を標準化する"],"ko":["클라우드 기반 프로젝트의 아키텍처 결정 사항을 문서화하는 것","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처를 위한 ADR 생성","개발 팀 전체에서 솔루션 문서화를 표준화하는 것"],"es":["Documentar decisiones arquitectónicas para proyectos basados en la nube","Generar ADR para arquitectura de microservicios","Establecer la documentación de soluciones estandarizadas en equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Documenter les décisions architecturales pour les projets basés sur le cloud","Générer des ADR pour l''architecture de microservices","Standardiser la documentation des solutions à travers les équipes de développement"],"de":["Dokumentation von Architekturentscheidungen für Cloud-basierte Projekte","Erstellung von ADR für Mikroservice-Architektur","Standardisierung der Lösungsdokumentation über Entwicklerteams hinweg"],"pt":["Documentar decisões arquiteturais para projetos baseados em nuvem","Gerar ADRs para arquitetura de microsserviços","Padronizar a documentação de soluções em equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Документирование архитектурных решений для облачных проектов","Генерация АР для архитектуры микросервисов","Стандартизация документации решений в командах разработки"],"ar":["توثيق القرارات المعمارية لمشاريع قائمة على السحابة","إنتاج سجلات قرارات معمارية لعمارة الخدمات المايكروية","توحيد توثيق الحلول عبر فرق التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires key information about the architectural decision","Limited to the MADR template structure"],"zh":["需要有关架构决策的关键信息","仅限于MADR模板结构"],"ja":["アーキテクチャの意思決定に関する重要な情報が必要","MADRテンプレートの構造に限定される"],"ko":["아키텍처 결정 사항에 대한 주요 정보가 필요","MADR 템플릿 구조에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere información clave sobre la decisión arquitectónica","Limitado a la estructura de la plantilla MADR"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations clés sur la décision architecturale","Limité à la structure du modèle MADR"],"de":["Benötigt wichtige Informationen über die Architekturentscheidung","Begrenzt auf die Struktur der MADR-Vorlage"],"pt":["Exige informações-chave sobre a decisão arquitetural","Limitado à estrutura do modelo MADR"],"ru":["Требует ключевой информации о архитектурном решении","Ограничен структурой шаблона MADR"],"ar":["يتطلب معلومات أساسية حول القرار المعماري","محدود بهيكل قالب MADR"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4adfff1b3b7d858415fa66e36fc6c8769248fa2fe26d091ede06e4242140df08","qualityScore":57}');
