INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jhd3197/CachiBot/review-fix', 'review-fix', 'jhd3197', 'CachiBot', 'community', 'review-fix jhd3197 CachiBot community ai ai-agents chatbot claude discord-bot llm prompture python telegram-bot The review-fix skill automates the review and fix process for AI agents, benefiting developers by planning and executing fixes from the last review. It supports multi-provider LLM and produces review-plan and review-execution logs. Review Fix 是一种 AI 驱动的代码修复工具，使用 Python 和 LLM 支持 Review Fix は、Python と LLM を使用した AI ドリブンのコード修正ツールです Review Fix 는 Python 및 LLM 을 사용하는 AI 기반 코드 자동화 툴입니다 Review Fix es una habilidad que ejecuta correcciones automatizadas en función de la última revisión. Soporta múltiples proveedores LLM y ejecución sandbox Review Fix est une compétence qui exécute des corrections automatiques en fonction de la dernière revue. Il prend en charge plusieurs fournisseurs LLM et l''exécution sandbox Review Fix ist eine Fähigkeit, die automatisierte Korrekturen auf der Grundlage der letzten Überprüfung ausführt. Sie unterstützt mehrere LLM-Anbieter und die Sandbox-Ausführung O Review-Fix é uma ferramenta que planeja e executa correções em seu código com base em revisões recentes Review-Fix - это инструмент, который планирует и выполняет исправления в вашем коде на основе последних обзоров для ИИ Агентов Review-Fix هو أداة لتخطيط وتنفيذ تصحيح العيوب في رمزك بناءً على المراجعات الأخيرة ل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use review-fix review-fix setup guide review-fix alternative review-fix vs claude review-fix install what is review-fix review-fix for AI agents review-fix and LLM review-fix automated review review-fix execution logs AIエージェント 代码自动化 Review Fix Python LLM 代码优化 自动化修复 AI工具 代码分析 Reads the most recent .reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-review.md file and parses findings into a list Plans fixes for all findings grouped by priority Executes every planned fix with atomic commits Produces review-plan and review-execution logs Supports multi-provider LLM Globs for .reviews/*-review.md files to find the latest review review-fix is a skill that automates the review and fix process for AI agents, parsing findings from review files and executing planned fixes with atomic commits.');
